@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

'------------------------
' Classes principales
'------------------------

class ContactModel {
    - dataSource
    + ajouter_contact()
    + rechercher_contacts()
    + modifier_contact()
    + supprimer_contact()
    + obtenir_tous()
}

class CarnetAdressesView {
    - interface
    + afficher_contacts()
    + afficher_message()
    + lire_saisie()
    + reinitialiser_formulaire()
    ' The view defines what it can do, but doesn't call the controller directly
}

class CarnetAdressesController {
    - model: ContactModel
    - view: CarnetAdressesView
    + ajouter_contact()
    + rechercher_contact()
    + modifier_contact()
    + supprimer_contact()
    + afficher_tous()
}

'------------------------
' Relations (Decoupled)
'------------------------

' The Controller "Controls" both. 
' It listens to the View and updates the Model.
CarnetAdressesController "1" --> "1" ContactModel : manipule
CarnetAdressesController "1" --> "1" CarnetAdressesView : met à jour / écoute

' Removed: CarnetAdressesView --> CarnetAdressesController
' In pure MVC, the View shouldn't hold a reference to the Controller 
' to maintain a one-way dependency flow.
@enduml